\section{Sample selection and data analysis} \label{2}


To study exoplanet habitability, we download the list of exoplanets from NASA Exoplanet Archive\footnote{\href{https://exoplanetarchive.ipac.caltech.edu/ on 18 November, 2024}{NASA Exoplanet Archive}}, applying sample selection criteria with a radius $\leq 4R_{\oplus}$ and a mass $\leq\,15M_{\oplus}$. We opt for these thresholds to focus on the habitability of terrestrial core planets with comparable Earth radius. The selection criteria provided with 881 planets with number of repetitive entries from multiple studies and observations. We identify a total of 339 exoplanets after removing duplicates and filtering out planets with missing measurements on radius, semi-major axis and stellar effective temperature.


