    \caption{Radius-period relationship of exoplanets. The exoplanets in the sample are color-coded according to their bulk densities. The black solid lines depict the radius-period trends for the TDML and GDF formation mechanisms, as defined by M19 and CM20, respectively. The gray-shaded region highlights the overlap between the two trends.}
