%
Based on this observation, we split the studied time period into three eras: the pre-millennia era (1961-1999), the early 21st century (2000-2019), and the 2020s (2020-2024). 
%
We speculate that the last split is related to the COVID-19 pandemic which notably impacted the culture of STEM research \citep{Heo2022}. 
