     \centering
     \includegraphics[width=0.5\linewidth,frame]{images/image.png}
     \caption{Attacker trying to engage its victim.}
     \label{fig:1}
 \end{figure}

The interaction began with what appeared to be a standard recruitment message, containing project details that aligned with the target’s professional expertise and current industry trends. The attacker followed up by requesting that the target download and run a codebase hosted on \textit{Bitbucket}, presented as part of a skill assessment process. However, as communication progressed, subtle signs raised suspicion, prompting the target to further investigate the provided code.

