 \end{figure}

Upon examination, the codebase was found to contain obfuscated scripts designed to perform unauthorized actions on the target’s system. This discovery revealed the true nature of the message: a well-crafted attempt to execute malicious code under the guise of a professional opportunity. The following report outlines the timeline of events, initial detection, and subsequent findings, detailing the approach used by the attacker and the potential risks identified.

