\textbf{\textit{bow}}  was previously employed as a \textit{Browser credentials' dumper}. However, by deobfuscating this script, beside the aforementioned well-known malicious functionality, designed to steal browser's credentials, there was found, embedded and obfuscated, an additional malicious payload with the aim of delivery the \textit{Tsunami} toolset.

