Internally, the class uses helper methods to parse and extract relevant information from the outputs of \textit{WMIC commands}, \textit{registry queries}, and \textit{API responses}. The use of both \textit{.NET} libraries and \textit{unmanaged} code illustrates a hybrid approach, enabling the class to access a wide range of system information.

