For the examples in this section, we did not need to use the full strength of the results obtained in Section~\ref{sec:dirac} involving the twisted cohomology ring. However, a more detailed study of the twisted cohomology ring appears to play an important role in understanding other examples, such as the Klein four group and the quaternion group. A more detailed treatment of these cases is left for future work.
