By Claim V, there exists a unique scalar $\alpha_x \in [0, 1]$ such that $\delta_x \indiff \mix(p^*, p^\circ, \alpha_x)$.
We define the utility of outcome $x$ as this unique scalar: $u(x) = \alpha_x$.
