\caption{\textbf{Results of sampling the genome scale metabolic model informed by the nanoSIMS, maxEnt data and exchanges. } 
\textbf{A.} Scatter plot of the enolase reaction.
\textbf{B.} Rubisco efficiency vs. growth rate  \label{FigS9}}  
