%While our theoretical framework eliminates the need for input observation when measuring mutual information, implementing dual reporters presents experimental challenges.
%The original study addressed these challenges through careful design considerations, including symmetrical placement of reporter genes and maintenance of genetic sequence similarity \cite{Elowitz2002-vg}.
