    &\quad+ \sum_{t,s\neq t}(-e_te_s)\mu_t\mu_s + e_tE[(\mu_t(X) - \mu_t)|T=s]e_s\mu_s + e_sE[(\mu_s(X) - \mu_s)|T=t]e_t\mu_t\\ 
